              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi ahagurukana n’abantu bose bari kumwe na we, bajabuka Yorodani; bgakeye hadasigaye n’ umwe muri bo atājabutse Yorodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
