        {
          "text": "Kandi Abusalomu yari yagize Amasa umugabisha w’ingabo mu gishingo ca Yowabu. Kandi Amasa uwo yari mwene Yitura, umuntu w’Umwishimayeli; uyo Yitura yari yaratahiye Abigayili mwene Nahashi, Abigayili mwene nyina wa Seruwiya, Seruwiya nyina wa Yowabu. ",
          "type": "text",
