          "text": "Nuko Dawidi ashitse i Mahanayimu, Shobi mwene Nahashi w’i Raba mu Bamoni, na Makiri mwene Amiyeli w’i Lo‐debari, na Baruzilayi Umunyagileyadi w’i Rogelimu, ",
